"Existing gear control overlaps a newly calibrated AETR axis; reassign that "
"auxiliary channel."
msgstr ""
"Le réglage existant du train d’atterrissage chevauche un axe AETR "
"nouvellement étalonné ; réaffectez ce canal auxiliaire."

msgid ""
"Existing smoke control overlaps a newly calibrated AETR axis; smoke was "
